    <string name="privacy_data_body">Your GIFs, frames and settings live only in the app\'s private storage. No other app can read them. Uninstalling the app deletes them.</string>
    <string name="privacy_backup_title">Backups</string>
    <string name="privacy_backup_body">The app\'s rules exclude Google cloud backup; the library only moves to a new phone through direct device-to-device transfer (Android 12 or later). For your own copy use Export in Settings.</string>
    <string name="privacy_background_title">Background</string>
    <string name="privacy_background_body">The app keeps no services or processes alive. It only does short jobs when you tap a widget, resize it and, if you turn on the night schedule, one inexact alarm that does not wake the phone.</string>
    <string name="privacy_deps_title">Components it uses</string>
    <string name="privacy_deps_body">Android and Jetpack libraries (Core, Activity, Lifecycle, Compose and Material 3) and Kotlin with coroutines. The GIF decoder and the WebP conversion are our own. No Google Play services, no analytics, no ads, no AI models.</string>

